---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { profile, profileExperience, education, expertise, url } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="About" active="about">
  <section class="page-intro shell"><p class="eyebrow">The person behind the code</p><h1>Hi, I’m Khalil.<br /><em>I like to look underneath.</em></h1><p>I’m a software infrastructure engineer based in Dresden, Germany. My work sits across distributed systems, HPC scheduling, and the software that configures and controls real machines.</p></section>
  <section class="about-grid shell"><div class="about-copy"><p>I came to software through physics, then studied software engineering and computer science in Tunisia and Germany. Algorithms and systems became the thread connecting them: understand the model, inspect the constraints, then build something that behaves predictably.</p><p>My technical interests include topology-aware allocation, graph algorithms, concurrency, and systems debugging. At Rohde & Schwarz, I investigated performance and timing problems in signal-processing libraries, Linux guests, and networking systems.</p><p>In my own projects, I make these ideas easier to inspect. My public work includes the topology-aware workload-management project and SchedLab, an interactive scheduling laboratory. This site is where I document their architecture and the decisions I’m still working through.</p><div class="project-links"><a class="text-link" href={url('work/')}>Work & projects ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find me on GitHub ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={profile.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Connect on LinkedIn ↗</a></div></div><aside class="about-card"><div class="initials" aria-hidden="true">kbm.</div><dl><div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>Dresden, Germany</dd></div><div><dt>Primary languages</dt><dd>C++ & Python</dd></div><div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Systems & infrastructure</dd></div><div><dt>Outside the day job</dt><dd>Algorithms & teaching tools</dd></div></dl><a class="button button-dark" href={url('resume.pdf')} download="Khalil_Ben_Maaoui_CV.pdf">Download résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></aside></section>
  <section id="experience" class="experience-section shell"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Background</span><h2>Selected experience.</h2>{profileExperience.map(e => <article class="experience-row"><div><span class="eyebrow">{e.date}</span><h3>{e.company}</h3><span class="experience-location">{e.location}</span></div><div><h4 class="role-heading">{e.role}</h4><p>{e.intro}</p>{e.details.length > 0 && <ul>{e.details.map(d => <li>{d}</li>)}</ul>}</div></article>)}</section>
  <section class="section shell" style="padding-top:0"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Technical practice</span><h2 style="margin-top:15px">The tools, and the thinking.</h2><div class="expertise-grid">{expertise.map(e => <div class="expertise-item"><span class="expertise-number">{e.number} /</span><h3>{e.name}</h3><p>{e.description}</p><div class="skill-tags">{e.tags.map(t => <span>{t}</span>)}</div></div>)}</div><p class="section-intro" style="margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:0">Other tools I’ve used include Docker, QEMU, DPDK, Wireshark, systemd, journalctl, Bash, Pytest, Playwright, and GitHub Actions.</p></section>
  <section class="section shell" style="padding-top:0"><span class="eyebrow">03 / Education</span><h2 style="margin-top:15px">A foundation in physics & software.</h2><div class="education-grid">{education.map(e => <div><span class="eyebrow">{e.date} · {e.place}</span><h3>{e.degree}</h3><p>{e.school}</p></div>)}</div></section>
  <section class="about-bottom shell"><div><h2>Algorithms, off the clock.</h2><p>Three years of competitive programming and more than 600 problems solved. At IEEEXtreme 17.0 in 2023, my team ranked 21st of 1,048 in Tunisia and 849th of 8,263 worldwide.</p></div><div><h2>Languages.</h2><div class="language-list"><span>Arabic · native</span><span>French · fluent</span><span>English · fluent</span><span>German · A1</span></div></div></section>
</Base>
